      "writtenOn": "2023-01-06T20:57:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I rechecked the patch. Another (and maybe the strongest) reason why it\u0027s needed is that the blamed commit was introduced in v5.18 and it\u0027s not available in linux-stable/linux-5.15.y, but available in aosp/android13-5.15-lts. Thus the fix will never arrive in 5.15.y if no-one has an interest in backporting the blamed commit as well. And we would end up waiting indefinitely for the fix to get to android.\n\nAnd regarding the first arguments, I prefer closing the bugs than spending time tracking them, I find the later more time consuming. At least that\u0027s what I feel until now.",
      "parentUuid": "727f65d8_286621a4",
      "revId": "965516abb209e4105b88bc2bf13dd37996ba1e7e",
